From 2aa2dc967aa509e867087d133820490d0e2fbc24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mingmingzhichu <lihaoyu0717@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 22:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8150: add the OnePlus 7T (hotdogb)

The OnePlus 7T is an sm8150 phone with a 6.55" 1080x2400 DSC panel, a
Synaptics rmi4 touchscreen, two TFA9874 speaker amplifiers on the
quaternary MI2S and a WCD9340 codec.  Add the board and the pieces of
the SoC that only this board uses so far:

  - the APR services exposed by the ADSP (q6afe, q6asm, q6adm) plus the
    slim-ngd bus and the sound card node, needed by the WCD9340 codec;
  - the MDSS core reset;
  - the pm8150b charger and fuel gauge nodes.

The display panel, touchscreen, dwc3 and amplifier drivers are added by
separate patches.

Signed-off-by: mingmingzhichu <lihaoyu0717@outlook.com>
